item.description:
@Kaitlyn Hennessy  The *not even woke* take is that when you tell people they are subhuman for celebrating their oppressor suffering, while clapping along WHEN THAT OPPRESSOR OPPRESSES, you are maintaining the dehumanising system they build. Stop. It’s racist. If u don’t celebrate, don’t. But dehumanizing ppl for, when u urself love ppl who do, is disgusting.<br>
<br>
